cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, cite the sources below. The projections ask for three citations; the facilities are OpenStreetMap's, under the ODbL."
title: "Sea-level rise at Manila's health facilities: AR6 projections for eight Philippine tide gauges"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "The Fieldwork project (digital-twin-ph)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/digital-twin-ph/example-2026-sea-level-rise-philippines"
abstract: "IPCC AR6 sea-level projections for eight Philippine tide gauges (CC BY 4.0), and 194 health facilities in coastal Manila from OpenStreetMap (ODbL 1.0), for teaching which projection applies to a place and what it does not say. Not a flood model."
